  "issue": "The recent changes to the lexer mappings have introduced an issue with the import of certain lexers. Specifically, attempting to import `PrologLexer` now results in an `ImportError`. This seems to be affecting multiple areas where lexers are utilized, causing errors during the collection phase of the test suite.\n\nTo reproduce the issue, you can try the following steps:\n\n1. Ensure you have the latest changes from the repository.\n2. Attempt to import `PrologLexer` in a Python environment:\n   ```python\n   from pygments.lexers import PrologLexer\n   ```\n3. Observe the `ImportError` that is raised, indicating that `PrologLexer` cannot be found.\n\nThis issue is causing disruptions in various test files, as the lexers are integral to their functionality. It would be great to have this resolved to ensure smooth operation and testing.",
